      "writtenOn": "2017-03-06T02:27:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We also needn\u0027t do the other initialization stuff of LRESET. Please see the following patch. I also verified it on poppy in my side.\n\ndiff --git a/chip/npcx/lpc.c b/chip/npcx/lpc.c\nindex e8b59f1..f981a39 100644\n--- a/chip/npcx/lpc.c\n+++ b/chip/npcx/lpc.c\n@@ -1098,6 +1098,7 @@ static void lpc_init(void)\n        /* initial IO port address via SIB-write modules */\n        host_register_init();\n #else\n+#ifndef CONFIG_ESPI\n        /* Initialize LRESET# interrupt */\n        /* Set detection mode to edge */\n        CLEAR_BIT(NPCX_WKMOD(MIWU_TABLE_0, MIWU_GROUP_5), 7);\n@@ -1106,6 +1107,7 @@ static void lpc_init(void)\n        /* Enable wake-up input sources */\n        SET_BIT(NPCX_WKEN(MIWU_TABLE_0, MIWU_GROUP_5), 7);\n #endif\n+#endif\n }\n /*\n  * Set prio to higher than default; this way LPC memory mapped data is ready",
      "parentUuid": "10cb0331_7c7ac4f9",
